+## Checking against your budgets
+
+If you have configured per-category budget limits (in `tally/config.py`), the
+`budget` command shows how much you have spent in each category for a given month
+alongside the limit you set, so you can see at a glance where you are over or under:
+
+```
+python -m tally.cli budget --month 2024-03
+```
+
+Categories with no configured limit are not shown.
+
